==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Othom]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Relic Bun-Bun]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**10 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Oldhorn]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**1 [[Othom]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is essentially [[An Ancient Curse]] but with extra relic support. Use the loadout you used for that stage, but add some support involving the new enemies. [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Rodeo Cat]] with Talents can serve as a crowd controller against Relic Bun Bun and the Oldhorns, and [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Awakened Mina]] can be stacked at the start to assist against all the enemies.

